# The deployed site is the static evidence bundle in web/ and nothing else:
# index.html plus data.json, no build step, no external assets. The collector,
# analysis engine and archive run on the collection machine, not on Vercel.
#
# Excluding them keeps the deployment small and stops Vercel from mistaking a
# Python source tree for something it needs to build.

palimpsest/
tests/
scripts/
docs/
archive/
.github/
.claude/
*.md
